## The whole wave is one named-crest profile (wave_profile, from waves.alib),
## scrolled rightward with the scroll command. Peaks: 1,3,2,4,2,1,4,2,1 over a
## 46-tube period. A plain scroll (no slides/blanking) loops seamlessly.

title|Waves
import|waves.alib
scale|0.12
loop|forever

scroll|anon|2|wave_profile|direction=right
